WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Right, so I went to Texas, and everything is absolutely massive! The steaks, the trucks, the hats...

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:16.000
I asked for a 'small' portion and they brought me enough food to feed my entire street back in London!

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
And when I said 'lovely weather, isn't it?', the bloke looked at me like I was speaking Martian!

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:33.500
He goes 'Y'all ain't from around here, are ya?' I'm like, what gave it away? The accent or the umbrella?

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:43.500
They took me to a rodeo. Brilliant! In England, the most exciting animal event is watching the Queen's corgis!

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:56.500
Anyway, Texas was proper mental! But I do miss a good cuppa. Their tea is... well, it's iced. Iced! The audacity!
